t Connection":["Prueba de conexi\u00f3n"],"Connection Error":["Error de conexi\u00f3n"],"Upgrade":["Actualizar"],"Deactivate":["Desactivar"],"This source is not used by any feeds.":[""],"Are you sure you want to delete it?":[""],"feed":[""],"This source is used by":[""],"Delete ":["Eliminar "],"Source Deleted!":["\u00a1Fuente eliminada!"],"Select feed to export":[""],"Export":["Exportar"],"Original Text":["Texto original"],"Custom text\/translation":["Personalizar texto\/traducci\u00f3n"],"Context":["Contexto"],"New Reviews collected daily.":["Se recopilan nuevas rese\u00f1as a diario."],"Clearing caches will trigger a full resync of all reviews. This may take a few minutes and could temporarily slow down your site.":[""],"Clear All Caches":["Vaciar todas la cach\u00e9s"],"You are using the Lite version of the plugin\u2013no license needed. Enjoy! \ud83d\ude42 To unlock more features, consider ":["Est\u00e1s usando la versi\u00f3n Lite del plugin\u2013no necesitas licencia. \u00a1Que lo disfrutes! \ud83d\ude42 Para desbloquear m\u00e1s funciones, considera "],"Upgrading to Pro":["pasarte a Pro"],"As a valued user of our Lite plugin, you receive 50% OFF - automatically applied at checkout!":["Como valioso usuario de nuestro plugin Lite, recibir\u00e1s un 50% de descuento, que se aplicar\u00e1 autom\u00e1ticamente en el momento del pago."],"Install Pro":["Instalar Pro"],"Select collection to export":[""],"Collection JSON exported!":[""],"Save Changes":["Guardar los cambios"],"Plugin Installed":["Plugin instalado"],"Unknown Error":["Error desconocido"],"Plugin Activated":["Plugin activado"],"Plugin Deactivated":["Plugin desactivado"],"About Us":["Sobre nosotros"],"SmashBalloon Team":["Equipo de SmashBalloon"],"At Smash Balloon, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["En Smash Balloon, creamos un software que te ayuda a crear hermosos feeds de redes sociales adaptables para tu web en cuesti\u00f3n de minutos."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["Estamos en una misi\u00f3n para hacer que sea s\u00faper sencillo a\u00f1adir feeds de redes sociales en WordPress. Se acabaron los complicados pasos de configuraci\u00f3n, los feos widgets iframe y las puntuaciones negativas de velocidad de p\u00e1gina."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["Nuestros plugins no s\u00f3lo son f\u00e1ciles de usar, sino que son completamente personalizables, fiables y r\u00e1pidos. Por eso, m\u00e1s de 1,6 millones de usuarios incre\u00edbles, como t\u00fa, eligen utilizarlos en su web."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Nuestros otros plugins de redes sociales"],"We're more than just a Reviews plugin! Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":["\u00a1Somos m\u00e1s que un plugin de Rese\u00f1as! Echa un vistazo a nuestros otros plugins y a\u00f1ade m\u00e1s contenido a tu sitio."],"Install":["Instalar"],"Installed":["Instalado"],"Social Wall":["Social Wall"],"Combine feeds from all of our plugins into a single wall":["Combinar feeds de todos nuestros plugins en un solo muro"],"Plugins we recommend":["Plugins que recomendamos"],"What are they used for?":[""],"Solving an issue in your plugin might sometime require testing API access but with your setup. We do not want to expose your API keys over support messages and hence we use a temporary login link system to securely access it.":[""],"What can a support executive access?":[""],"A support team member can only access Smash Balloon plugin to make API requests. They can NOT access any other plugins, create posts or in any way modify your WordPress website.":[""],"Can I disable or delete the temporary login link?":[""],"The login link is auto-destroyed in 14 days. You can also manually delete it any time you want.":[""],"Temporary Login Links":[""],"Dismiss":["Descartar"],"Search Documentation":["Buscar en la documentaci\u00f3n"],"Need more support? We're here to help.":["\u00bfNecesitas m\u00e1s ayuda? Estamos aqu\u00ed para ayudarte."],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Env\u00eda un ticket de soporte"],"Get Help in the WordPress.org Forum":["Obt\u00e9n ayuda en el foro de WordPress.org"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["Nuestro r\u00e1pido y amable equipo de soporte est\u00e1 siempre dispuesto a ayudar."],"System Info":["Informaci\u00f3n del sistema"],"Collapse":["Cerrar"],"Expand":["Ampliar"],"Export Settings":["Exportar ajustes"],"Share your plugin settings easily with Support":["Comparte f\u00e1cilmente los ajustes de tu plugin con soporte"],"Temporary Login":[""],"Our team might require temporary login access with limited access to only our plugin to help you test your issues":[""],"Create Temporary Login Link":[""],"Temporary User Created":[""],"Temporary Login link for support access created by you. This is auto-destructed 14 days after creation. To create a new link, please delete the old one.":[""],"Link":["Enlace"],"Temporary User Deleted":[""],"Please enter you business name as it is in Google":[""],"Business name to search for Place ID":[""],"Business ID found":[""],"Clear Log":[""],"Code":[""],"Details":[""],"Moderate review feeds":["Moderar los feeds de rese\u00f1as"],"Display images and videos":["Mostrar im\u00e1genes y v\u00eddeos"],"Upsell Modal Icon":["Icono de la ventana emergente de venta dirigida"],"And get much more!":["\u00a1Y consigue mucho m\u00e1s!"],"Add reviews to your collection":[""],"Organize reviews into collections, embed collections on any page":[""],"Collections help you organize your reviews in collections such as \u201cHomepage reviews\u201d or \u201cProduct reviews\u201d. You can then use them as a reviews source in any feed.":[""],"Add your first review to this collection":[""],"Add reviews from Google, Facebook, TrustPilot or Yelp. Collections help you hand-pick reviews and embed them on pages.":[""],"Create handpicked reviews collections to make the best first impression.":[""],"Or get them from your audience":[""],"You can also connect a form from WPForms or Formidable forms.":[""],"Add these collections as source on any feed. These work just like any other sources.":[""],"Name your Collection":[""],"Eg. Homepage Reviews":[""],"What are collections?":[""],"By duplicating this collection, all the reviews created and added to this collection will be duplicated too!":[""],"By deleting this collection, all the reviews created and added for it will be deleted too":[""],"Empty Collections Icon":[""],"Create collections of handpicked reviews to showcase them on your website, reviews page or product page":[""],"Okay, got it":[""],"Refresh List":[""],"No reviews found!":[""],"Add the review by manually typing it out":[""],"Or Add from existing source":[""],"Add the review from an existing source you have already connected":[""],"Select Reviewer Avatar Image":[""],"Use this media":[""],"Add Image to Review":[""],"You are about to edit this review":[""],"This review is displayed in":[""],"feeds. Editing it will change it on both those places. This action is irreversible.":[""],"User Avatar":[""],"Add Reviewer Image":[""],"Remove reviewer image":[""],"Rate %d star":[""],"Rate %d stars":[""],"First Name":[""],"John":[""],"Dow":[""],"The review title goes here":[""],"The content title goes here":[""],"Link to the review (Optional)":[""],"Posted on":[""],"Remove image":[""],"There are no reviews in this source, please select another source!":[""],"Selected Reviews added to your collection":[""],"Collection Name Updated":[""],"Back to All Collections":[""],"Rename collection":[""],"Update the Collection Name":[""],"Save collection name":[""],"Your collection adds any reviews submitted from this form to